---
code: records-torn-line
when-fires: a line that looks like ours carried no terminal token, so it lost its terminating write. plan/records.rs admit_records (the strict admission path); the forgiving deframer emits it too. `{count}` is what was seen before the walk stopped.
why: 262 §1 pin-late-and-alien-records: the tear is DETECTED rather than parsed, which is what keeps a truncated coordinate from reading as a valid shorter one.
---
